# Task 5 (tor-enhancement-phase1): boot-time Tor hidden-service persist
# reconcile. Re-applies the torrc HiddenService* stanza for every `active`
# emancipated service (see api/main.py: tor_reconcile_persist) whose HS dir
# is currently absent — idempotent, never re-creates an existing HS dir, so
# .onion addresses survive reboots unchanged. Runs as root (torrc + systemctl
# reload tor need privilege), invoked by
# secubox-exposure-tor-reconcile.service on boot.
exec /usr/bin/python3 -c "import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/usr/lib/secubox/exposure'); import api.main as m; m.tor_reconcile_persist()"
